# Soundingboard — Cursor AI Instructions

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` in this directory — it is the canonical instruction set for all agents operating in this workspace.

Cursor-Specific Safeguards:
1. NEVER perform destructive full-file rewrites of manuscript chapters in `stages/03_drafting/output/chapters/`. Always make targeted, localized line or paragraph replacements.
2. For developmental edits and diagnostic revisions, provide proposed before/after snippets in chat using the Revision Playbook format before modifying existing markdown files.
3. Consult `docs/harnesses/cursor_windsurf_guide.md` for complete IDE guidelines.
